(488, 'pages', 'title', 26, 'en', 'data-aether-auto', '2025-12-02 07:47:39', '2025-12-02 07:47:39'),
(491, 'pages', 'content', 26, 'en', '<section><div class=\"mt-6 mb-12\"><p class=\"text-lg text-secondary leading-relaxed\">This attribute is the \"Plug and Play\" feature of AetherJS. It boots up the library with default settings without requiring any additional JavaScript configuration.</p></div></section><hr class=\"border-primary my-12 opactiy-50\"><section><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-primary mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center justify-center size-8 rounded bg-secondary text-accent text-sm font-mono border border-accent\">01</span> Usage</h2><p class=\"text-secondary mb-6\">This attribute must be added to the <span class=\"highlight-marker\">body</span> tag of your page. When the library is loaded, it searches for this attribute on the DOM and triggers the initialization if found.</p><div class=\"bg-secondary rounded-3xl border border-primary overflow-hidden mb-8\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 border-b border-primary\"><div class=\"flex space-x-2\"><div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-400/80\"></div><div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-amber-400/80\"></div><div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-400/80\"></div></div><div class=\"text-xs text-tertiary font-mono\">index.html</div></div><div class=\"bg-primary p-6 max-h-[600px] overflow-auto\"><pre class=\"font-mono text-[13px] leading-6 text-code-prop\"><span class=\"text-code-tag\">&lt;body</span> <span class=\"text-code-prop highlight-marker\">data-aether-auto</span><span class=\"text-code-tag\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"text-code-muted\">...</span>\n<span class=\"text-code-tag\">&lt;/body&gt;</span></pre></div></div></section><hr class=\"border-primary my-12 opactiy-50\"><section><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-primary mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center justify-center size-8 rounded bg-secondary text-accent text-sm font-mono border border-accent\">02</span> Important Notes</h2><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-secondary border border-primary\"><div><h4 class=\"text-primary font-bold mb-2\">When Not to Use?</h4><p class=\"text-secondary leading-relaxed text-sm\">If you need to change the library\'s default settings (for example, if you want to change the <span class=\"highlight-marker\">prefix</span> or turn off <span class=\"highlight-marker\">debug</span> mode in a production environment), <strong>do not use</strong> the <span class=\"highlight-marker\">data-aether-auto</span> attribute.</p><p class=\"text-secondary leading-relaxed text-sm mt-3\">Instead, manually call the <span class=\"highlight-marker\">AetherUI.init({...})</span> function after the script file.</p></div></div></section>', '2025-12-02 07:47:39', '2026-02-27 08:11:00'),
(494, 'pages', 'slug', 28, 'en', 'data-aether-active-class-and-inactive-class', '2025-12-02 09:20:37', '2025-12-04 04:27:38'),
(497, 'pages', 'title', 28, 'en', 'data-aether-active-class & inactive-class', '2025-12-02 09:20:37', '2025-12-04 04:27:38'),
(500, 'pages', 'content', 28, 'en', '<section><div class=\"mt-6 mb-12\"><p class=\"text-lg text-secondary leading-relaxed\">AetherJS is unstyled by default. These two attributes allow you to dynamically swap CSS classes based on the state of elements (Open/Closed, Selected/Unselected).</p></div></section><hr class=\"border-primary my-12 opactiy-50\"><section><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-primary mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center justify-center size-8 rounded bg-secondary text-accent text-sm font-mono border border-accent\">01</span> Operating Principle</h2><p class=\"text-secondary mb-6\">When an element becomes active, the system removes the classes in <span class=\"highlight-marker\">inactive-class</span> and adds those in <span class=\"highlight-marker\">active-class</span>. It does the exact opposite when the element becomes passive.</p><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-primary bg-primary mb-8\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"border-b border-primary bg-secondary text-primary\"><th class=\"px-6 py-4 font-semibold\">Attribute</th><th class=\"px-6 py-4 font-semibold\">Role</th><th class=\"px-6 py-4 font-semibold\">Typical Usage</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-primary text-secondary\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-primary-interactive transition-colors\"><td class=\"px-6 py-4 font-mono text-primary\"><span class=\"highlight-marker\">data-aether-active-class</span></td><td class=\"px-6 py-4\">Classes to be applied when the element is active.</td><td class=\"px-6 py-4\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs bg-primary px-2 py-1 rounded border border-primary\">bg-blue-600 text-white</span> (For buttons)<br><span class=\"font-mono text-xs bg-primary px-2 py-1 rounded border border-primary mt-1 inline-block\">block</span> (For targets)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-primary-interactive transition-colors\"><td class=\"px-6 py-4 font-mono text-primary\"><span class=\"highlight-marker\">data-aether-inactive-class</span></td><td class=\"px-6 py-4\">Classes to be applied when the element is passive.</td><td class=\"px-6 py-4\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs bg-primary px-2 py-1 rounded border border-primary\">bg-gray-200 text-gray-500</span> (For buttons)<br><span class=\"font-mono text-xs bg-primary px-2 py-1 rounded border border-primary mt-1 inline-block\">hidden</span> (For targets)</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><hr class=\"border-primary my-12 opactiy-50\"><section><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-primary mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center justify-center size-8 rounded bg-secondary text-accent text-sm font-mono border border-accent\">02</span> Usage</h2><p class=\"text-secondary mb-6\">It is particularly used in <strong>Tab</strong> and <strong>Accordion</strong> headers to indicate which item the user has selected.</p><div class=\"bg-secondary rounded-3xl border border-primary overflow-hidden mb-8\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 border-b border-primary\"><div class=\"flex space-x-2\"><div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-400/80\"></div><div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-amber-400/80\"></div><div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-400/80\"></div></div><div class=\"text-xs text-tertiary font-mono\">index.html</div></div><div class=\"bg-primary p-6 max-h-[600px] overflow-auto\"><pre class=\"font-mono text-[13px] leading-6 text-code-prop\"><span class=\"text-code-muted\">&lt;!-- Wrapper --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"text-code-tag\">&lt;div</span>\n    <span class=\"text-code-prop\">data-aether-ui</span>=<span class=\"text-code-value\">\"accordion-group\"</span>\n    <span class=\"text-code-prop\">data-aether-allow-multiple</span><span class=\"text-code-tag\">&gt;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"text-code-muted\">&lt;!-- Item 1 --&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"text-code-tag\">&lt;div&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"text-code-tag\">&lt;button</span>\n            <span class=\"text-code-prop\">class</span>=<span class=\"text-code-value\">\"cursor-pointer text-lg\"</span>\n            <span class=\"text-code-prop highlight-marker\">data-aether-active-class</span>=<span class=\"text-code-value\">\"text-accent\"</span>\n            <span class=\"text-code-prop highlight-marker\">data-aether-inactive-class</span>=<span class=\"text-code-value\">\"text-primary\"</span>\n            <span class=\"text-code-prop\">data-aether-trigger</span>=<span class=\"text-code-value\">\"accordion\"</span>\n            <span class=\"text-code-prop\">data-aether-target</span>=<span class=\"text-code-value\">\"brands\"</span><span class=\"text-code-tag\">&gt;</span>\n            Brands\n        <span class=\"text-code-tag\">&lt;/button&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"text-code-tag\">&lt;div</span>\n            <span class=\"text-code-prop\">id</span>=<span class=\"text-code-value\">\"brands\"</span>\n            <span class=\"text-code-prop\">class</span>=<span class=\"text-code-value\">\"text-secondary\"</span>\n            <span class=\"text-code-prop\">data-aether-ui</span>=<span class=\"text-code-value\">\"accordion-panel\"</span><span class=\"text-code-tag\">&gt;</span>\n            Nike, Adidas, Puma...\n        <span class=\"text-code-tag\">&lt;/div&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"text-code-tag\">&lt;/div&gt;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"text-code-muted\">&lt;!-- Item 2 --&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"text-code-tag\">&lt;div&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"text-code-tag\">&lt;button</span>\n            <span class=\"text-code-prop\">class</span>=<span class=\"text-code-value\">\"cursor-pointer text-lg\"</span>\n           <span class=\"text-code-prop highlight-marker\">data-aether-active-class</span>=<span class=\"text-code-value\">\"text-accent\"</span>\n            <span class=\"text-code-prop highlight-marker\">data-aether-inactive-class</span>=<span class=\"text-code-value\">\"text-primary\"</span>\n            <span class=\"text-code-prop\">data-aether-trigger</span>=<span class=\"text-code-value\">\"accordion\"</span>\n            <span class=\"text-code-prop\">data-aether-target</span>=<span class=\"text-code-value\">\"sizes\"</span><span class=\"text-code-tag\">&gt;</span>\n            Sizes\n        <span class=\"text-code-tag\">&lt;/button&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"text-code-tag\">&lt;div</span>\n            <span class=\"text-code-prop\">id</span>=<span class=\"text-code-value\">\"sizes\"</span>\n            <span class=\"text-code-prop\">class</span>=<span class=\"text-code-value\">\"text-secondary\"</span>\n            <span class=\"text-code-prop\">data-aether-ui</span>=<span class=\"text-code-value\">\"accordion-panel\"</span><span class=\"text-code-tag\">&gt;</span>\n            S, M, L, XL...\n        <span class=\"text-code-tag\">&lt;/div&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"text-code-tag\">&lt;/div&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"text-code-tag\">&lt;/div&gt;</span></pre></div></div></section>', '2025-12-02 09:20:37', '2026-02-27 08:14:06'),
